  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever a creature targeted by a persistent talent or within its area succeeds at its saving throw against the talent, it must attempt another saving throw against the effect. If a creature fails this second saving throw, it suffers the full effects of the talent, as if it had failed its first saving throw. Talents that do not require a saving throw to resist or lessen the talent’s effect do not benefit from this feat.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> +2 spell points</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/metamagic-feats#toc43\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
